{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，齊人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"二、夏，小邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"三、鄭殺其大夫申侯。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"其稱國以殺何？稱國以殺者，君殺大夫之辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"四、秋七月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳世子款、鄭世子華，盟于甯毋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"五、曹伯般卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"六、公子友如齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_70_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_70","textTraditional":"七、冬，葬曹昭公。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}